---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { PROJECT_NAME } from '../consts';
---
<Base title={`Help . ${PROJECT_NAME}`} description="Ask the RoylTEE help guide or contact support with a NEAR testnet wallet.">
  <section class="help pad">
    <div class="help-in">
      <span class="tag-sim">Simulated</span>
      <h1>Help</h1>
      <p class="lead">Ask about shares, vaults, payments and the testnet demo. The guide answers from the project notes and says so when something is not built.</p>
      <div class="panel" id="chat">
        <div class="panel-head"><h2>Help chat</h2><button type="button" class="btn no-chip outline" data-chat-reset>New chat</button></div>
        <div class="chat-log" data-chat-log aria-live="polite"></div>
        <form data-chat-form>
          <label class="sr" for="chat-input">Your question</label>
          <textarea id="chat-input" name="message" maxlength="1500" rows="3" placeholder="For example: what happens to unclaimed money when a share is sold?" required></textarea>
          <div class="row"><button class="btn no-chip dark" type="submit">Ask</button><span class="muted small" data-chat-status></span></div>
        </form>
        <p class="muted small">Use demo details only. Chat text is not stored by this site. Answers can be wrong; the design docs are the source of truth. A TEE label appears only on replies where NEAR AI Cloud reports signature_kind provider_tee. Attestation is not verified by this app.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel" id="support" data-support data-state="out">
        <h2>Contact support</h2>
        <p>Sign in with a NEAR testnet wallet to open a ticket. No email and no personal data. Your wallet signs a message that never becomes a transaction. A sign in lasts 15 minutes.</p>
        <div class="row out-only"><button type="button" class="btn no-chip dark" data-sign-in>Sign in with NEAR wallet</button></div>
        <div class="in-only">
          <div class="row"><span class="mono small" data-who></span><button type="button" class="btn no-chip outline" data-sign-out>Sign out</button></div>
          <form data-ticket-form>
            <label for="t-subject">Subject</label>
            <input id="t-subject" name="subject" maxlength="120" required />
            <label for="t-message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="t-message" name="message" maxlength="2000" rows="5" required></textarea>
            <p class="muted small">Never include a seed phrase, private key, email address, phone number or card number. The form refuses anything that looks like one.</p>
            <button class="btn no-chip dark" type="submit">Send ticket</button>
          </form>
          <h3>My tickets</h3>
          <ul class="tickets" data-tickets></ul>
        </div>
        <p class="muted small" data-support-status aria-live="polite"></p>
        <p class="muted small">Tickets live in private server storage, tied only to your wallet account id. They are never on chain or in logs. Open tickets expire 30 days after the last update. Closed tickets are deleted 30 days after they close.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<script>import '../scripts/help.ts';</script>
<style is:global>
  .help { padding-top: 7rem; padding-bottom: 8rem; }
  .help-in { max-width: 46rem; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .panel { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 1.5rem; display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
  .panel-head, .row { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .panel textarea, .panel input { width: 100%; font: inherit; padding: .75rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg); }
  .panel form { display: grid; gap: .6rem; }
  .chat-log { display: grid; gap: .75rem; max-height: 28rem; overflow: auto; }
  .chat-log:empty { display: none; }
  .turn { padding: .75rem 1rem; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg); }
  .turn.user { background: #fff4dd; }
  .turn .who { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .72rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; }
  .turn .tee { margin: .4rem 0 0; font-size: .78rem; }
  .turn a, .reply a { text-decoration: underline; }
  .small { font-size: .85rem; }
  .sr { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); }
  [data-state="out"] .in-only, [data-state="in"] .out-only { display: none; }
  .tickets { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: .75rem; }
  .ticket { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1rem; display: grid; gap: .4rem; }
  .ticket-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
  .reply { border-left: 3px solid var(--amber); padding-left: .75rem; }
</style>
